Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 21:36:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-148: laptop package 110's designer part merged
 into the machine tree -- ES02's 0.148 (0.148.0)

GitHub main 0fa9db2 (GitLab e6d4da65), mixed; its C++ / web part = the integration session's cpp 0081 (68ff728).
Three-way on the package's base_c4ddcada (= package 109), against the tree as it is now, CRLF to LF first:
extension.js, package.json, WPF_DIFF_LOG.md, test/panels_render.ps1, test/smoke_extension.js changed only by ES02
and lib/icons.js, media/solution.css, media/solution.js new -- copied byte for byte (panels_render.ps1 keeps its
UTF-8 BOM: Windows PowerShell 5.1 needs it for the Chinese in it); CHANGELOG.md, HANDOVER.md, test/run_tests.js on
both sides (git merge-file, no conflict; the machine's Alias test and notes kept). lib/aliasedit.js (the machine's
tools 0136 Alias patch) not in the package: the machine's copy stays.
ES02's 0.148: the Solution Explorer redone as ONE view (its search box right under the title, the tree below;
typing hides what does not match; VS Code's own icons; same keys and menu), and it no longer lists the BCB6 source
(only the C++ port tree and the web; BCB6 still found by Find / project search, opened as Big5, read only).
HANDOVER.md section 5: package 110; files taken from a package are copied as bytes, not text (the BOM).
Tests: lib 177/177, probe 7/7 + tab tree 7/7, extension 213/213, panels all pass; e2e_build.ps1 not run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
